{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34032","headline":"奉送浙东德师侍御罢府西归 · 皮日休","name":"奉送浙东德师侍御罢府西归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建安才子太微仙，暂上金台许二年。\n形影欲归温室树，梦魂犹傍越溪莲。\n空将海月爲京信，尚使樵风送酒船。\n从此受恩知有处，免爲伧鬼恨吴天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}